  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "This place... is filled with fallen Reunion.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...The blood from his wounds had been frozen, but his other body parts remained intact.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "This is Frostleaf's technique.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...Those ruins over there look like they were caused by explosives.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "It's probably Meteorite's work.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "(Frostleaf... Jessica... Meteorite... I'm sure they're still alive...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "Amiya, all the rescue squads have reached Rhodes Island.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "We've extracted all the recon squads except for Meteorite's.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "No Operators were lost on this mission, but...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "Everyone suffered frostbite with varying degrees of severity.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "You must take note of this.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...Frostbite?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "All our recon squads observed a special group of Reunion troops wandering around the city.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "Unlike the reckless Reunion soldiers we're used to fighting, these members had a special way of fighting.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "Be cautious.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I.... I understand.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, am I clear?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "I understand.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Very well then.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "I also have some things to do.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Amiya, even if Dr. {@nickname} is very helpful, you can't rely too much on a single person.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Also, mind the rings.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I know.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit actually worries about you a lot.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Before we realized it...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Dangerous beasts have bared their fangs.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Reunion is bearing down upon us.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Our retreat has been cut off...",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "These thugs really have it out for us.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Mm... They will do everything they can to keep us from getting away.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "But, we didn't come here to run away.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Rhodes Island will break through their ranks.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "We're going to rescue Meteorite's squad!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Projekt Red, do you copy?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Ahh, yes.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "That's right. I'll meet you at the slums' east entrance.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Mhm. It'll just be the two of us.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "We'll be fine.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Just the two of us are more than enough to fight against Reunion.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
